Terraform written from the diagram. TerraVision runs on your own computer and needs no cloud access."],"features":["✅ Built for AI assistants — marketplace extensions and plugins for Claude, Codex, Gemini, Copilot and Cursor; diagrams appear right in the chat in Claude Desktop and the ChatGPT desktop app (guide)","✅ Provably Accurate diagrams — accurate diagrams generated directly from your Terraform code so your code is the source of truth - what you see is what you get","✅ MCP server and agent skill — let any AI agent, or an assistant in an IDE such as Visual Studio Code, generate diagrams from a JSON graph or your Terraform (guide)","✅ In Diagram flow annotations — labels, titles, and flow sequences supported via YAML or generated by AI models including Ollama (running local) and AWS Bedrock","✅ JSON graph input — describe an architecture in a few lines of JSON and render it, resources match Terraform names so no need to learn a custom DSL (Graph Format)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickchugh/terravision/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a1df0c49575a1894c23d31efd3f8ce78f9c78453eab239c1896f443fd83ac48c","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:51.647Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:51.647Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Professional cloud architecture diagrams in official AWS, Azure and GCP style, from a description in Claude or ChatGPT or from your Terraform","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickchugh/terravision/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"✅ Built for AI assistants — marketplace extensions and plugins for Claude, Codex, Gemini, Copilot and Cursor; diagrams appear right in the chat in Claude Desktop and the ChatGPT desktop app (guide)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickchugh/terravision/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a1df0c49575a1894c23d31efd3f8ce78f9c78453eab239c1896f443fd83ac48c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickchugh/terravision/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T22